{"id":901,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为推动学生高质量充分就业，搭建校企对接平台，深化校企协同育人机制，促进产学研深度融合，2025年3月28日上午九点，中北大学化学与化工学院专场招聘会在东区训练馆成功举办。此次招聘会得到了中北大学招生与就业工作部的大力支持，吸引了数十家知名企业参会，提供了数百个工作岗位。招聘会上，学院党委书记吴志远、党委副书记蔡文涛与企业代表就人才需求、产学研合作等议题展开深入交流。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dL8V-RMz9bo7W7UWmLsozT7U4fVnm9HiUmAfM4MfLNQ7nNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVU1yYU1h2Lzn2M7rRL494nzV7Ml-bU4Lbnz94L47aolVFU4CPLNUYnRnFLzlPUzCJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg47aMmvagtA8pUgcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5EB2BF14F4EC383E1D5B9C39E833109A/C612D2D4/151A6\" vheight=\" 267px\" vwidth=\" 400px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dL4G-8L7M2oR67nWNrfnzAfoRvZnRCHYU4QkLmUaL7l8oz70gihFp2hmCIa0MSysU1hkLYysMl-ZL4Cao7CZnzCbUzCsU4l4nRMVn7Mkn7WFL4V7MmU8M46FMzNDMlCYgtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1yPLRCsLkbw62g8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.jpg\"><br /></p><p>招聘会现场气氛热烈，各企业通过宣讲会、发放宣传资料、现场讲解等方式，与求职者就岗位要求、薪资待遇等开展互动交流；同时，部分企业开设“现场面试直通车”，快速锁定人才。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dLRC-4LNlYUm98MW4VRnNW7oRC4U8MHVnNUaL8-aLm-YM470gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7MYhRnkyYUm62nRCYL4-DL4-ZL8Q2LmNiLlUio7UbnmTFM7r2MmWkLzfFLz9so7LJv2bjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg47aMmvagtA8pUgcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7D7CD2B7FD623263283FF2951D58D9F9/4EF62B10/1878C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=doz7-sLzf7nRlDLWN-iMNr7ozlYn7WHkMmlDL4vinzr2LRl0gihFp2hmCIa0M1h7nkhRM1yDU4MfM7C8LRLiU4lanzUZLzA2UzfVU4-8M4rFnlWkUm7DMmrFLlLDU4GYLYbaptveo4OeqdAjCsT/vYhXptQ0g47aMR-0LzGDM4GJqdgnx&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.png\"></p><p>参会企业高度认可毕业生扎实的理论基础与实践能力，学生们展现出与产业前沿需求的高度适配性。多元化的岗位需求与学院专业设置高度契合，助力毕业生实现“专业对口、高质量就业”。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dUmC-ZUNQ7M4MVnWzW7MRv4LmLaMRAHVLzrfolrfnR6knzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8nky8M1h7Uzl4UzQkU8n2MzNsL8Uanm78nlUZolLbU4rFMNlZUm-YLmWFLzMVMl-Jqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg47aMmvagtA8pUgcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D4D46DA53A6BCDF5973D0F14ED89C9C5/6E8B2222/13E5B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dUzr-7LRLDnmQknWNW2nmf7oRlZL8lHZU8CDLz74nN-8oz70gihFp2hmCIa0UShRL1yYn1hVLR6koR9soR78L46RM4lPLRCaozVVnNLiUNWFLzfkMlnknm6FLzGYMmGZgtXaQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1yPLRCsLkbw62g8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次专场招聘会的成功举办，是学院践行“为党育人、为国育才”使命的生动实践，也是校企携手推动行业高质量发展的重要举措。不仅提供了就业供需平台，而且成为了校企协同育人的纽带。学院将继续以人才培养为核心，以产业需求为导向，通过实习实训、产学研合作等举措，持续提升毕业生核心竞争力，促进毕业生高质量就业。</p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hgxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=dL8V-RMz9bo7W7UWmLsozT7U4fVnm9HiUmAfM4MfLNQ7nNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MShVU1yYU1h2Lzn2M7rRL494nzV7Ml-bU4Lbnz94L47aolVFU4CPLNUYnRnFLzlPUzCJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg47aMmvagtA8pUgcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=10670&e=.jpg"}